      <p style="font-size: 20px; color: #999; margin: 2rem 0 0 0; max-width: 520px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300;">
        From concept to production. React Native, React, Node.js. We ship products that matter.
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator, bottom left like the reference -->
    <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 48px; left: 48px; z-index: 10;">
      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #22d3ee; margin: 0 0 10px 0; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: 500;">Scroll down</p>
      <div style="width: 1px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #22d3ee 0%, transparent 100%); animation: scrollLine 2s infinite;"></div>
